  "description": "A reinforced full-body Holtzman field generator intended for sustained fighting. A larger reserve and improved recharge support prolonged exposure, at the cost of extra weight, plasteel and an advanced component. It shares the standard belt's limitations: fast projectiles and hurried melee blows are stopped, while skilled slow blades can penetrate; heat, explosions and EMP bypass the field. The field automatically rises when drafted, fighting or attacked. It lowers during ranged aiming, bursts and recovery so the wearer can shoot, then returns if combat continues. Blocked impacts postpone recharge for twelve seconds. Its emissions attract Makers on exposed sand, and lasgun contact causes a dangerous local overload. This military configuration is a frontier adaptation, not a different field technology.",
